word-list incidence table. An item contains its constructor identity and
seven optional partner slots. Pop one patch record, use Find to resolve
its old identities, check its probes and matching native-row guard, and
check the canonical alias-combined template computed from the current
decoded finite record. Apply the assignments by Replace and append the
new constructor roles by AppendItem, in their fixed order. A new vertex
initializes all seven slots, including empty ones. Retarget links and
commit receipt/control together in this virtual record. Check the native
erasure and its supplied/read/output labels by the same single Step rule.
T supplies its own IN labels. No endpoint is supplied beside the patch list.

Consume the complete list and require $k$ native occurrences with the bound
target version/phase. Traverse its tree layer using a word stack of
$(\mathrm{identity},\mathrm{path})$ and Find; emit the sorted support.
The work graph's initial scaffold is finite, each patch creates finitely
many nodes, and the traversal ends after its finite tree nodes. Head links
are verified from marks, and are not traversed as tree children. This is
virtual word computation, with every list lookup and update lowered to
bank instructions.

